{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeSJkXD7cy8Ta3AzYzKZL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Written to `.github/workflows/ci.yml`. The step follows SETUP.md's procedure (install Node → `npm ci` → `npm run build`) but not its Node 18 claim, because it's contradicted by the code.\n\n## What I found\n\n**SETUP.md is out of date.** It says Node 18; the project actually requires Node 20:\n\n| Source | Says |\n|---|---|\n| `SETUP.md` | Node 18 |\n| `package.json:6` (`engines`) | `>=20` |\n| `.nvmrc` | `20` |\n\nTwo live config files agree with each other and disagree with the doc, so I used Node 20. Pinning CI to 18 would have installed a version the package itself declares unsupported.\n\n## What I wrote\n\n- `actions/setup-node@v4` with `node-version-file: .nvmrc` — CI reads the version from the repo rather than hardcoding it, so this can't silently drift again. npm cache enabled.\n- `npm ci` then `npm run build`, per SETUP.md steps 2–3.\n- Triggers on pushes to `main` and all PRs.\n\n## Adjacent problems I did not fix (out of scope, flagging only)\n\n1. **No `package-lock.json`** — `npm ci` hard-fails without a lockfile. Run `npm install` once and commit the lock, or switch the step to `npm install`.\n2. **`build` runs `tsc -p .` but there's no `tsconfig.json` and no `typescript` dependency** in `package.json`. The build step will fail until those exist.\n3. **SETUP.md line 3** should be updated to say Node 20 (or \"the version in `.nvmrc`\") so the next reader isn't misled.\n\nItems 1–2 mean the workflow as committed will fail on first run until they're addressed — the CI step is correct, but the project isn't yet buildable. Say the word and I'll fix any of the three."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":56,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1202,"cache_read_input_tokens":23904,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1202},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"618b5582-aba8-45ee-9df7-166decd343df","uuid":"ad80ee48-0cd3-42dc-b69e-2e74679dc65c","timestamp":"2026-08-27T00:28:43.228Z","request_id":"req_011CeSJkV1f3KG2EwZQXqK4a"}
